  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the reaction,<br ><math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>Q</mtext> <mo>→</mo> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>S</mtext> </mrow> </math><br >the time taken for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>%</mo></math> reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo> </mo></math>is twice the time taken for<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo> </mo><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math> reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>. The concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo> </mo></math>varies with reaction time as shown in the figure.The overall order of the reaction is:<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/5ffa6d08-ef77-4d64-804d-cbb4d9ee09f7-image.png\"/>  </p>",
    "image": null
  },
